# .gitignore
#
# Git ignore rules — files that must never be versioned
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Entries are added only when the file or folder actually appears in the
# project, never in advance.

# ── Claude Code ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Personal working context for the AI assistant (not a project deliverable)
CLAUDE.md
# Local Claude Code settings and session data
.claude/

# ── Python virtual environments ───────────────────────────────────────
# One environment per workstation: a venv stores absolute paths, so it
# cannot be shared between the two machines
.venvgarciad/

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Bytecode cache generated by the interpreter
__pycache__/

# ── Django ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local development database
*.sqlite3

# ── Environment files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local secrets and settings, never versioned
.env
